      "detailed_description": "Since <strong>Nekomew</strong> moved to his new home he started having <strong>terrible nightmares</strong>... can you overcome them? Follow the 🎵<strong>rhythm of the music</strong>🎵... and avoid the <strong>spooky monsters</strong>!🙀 More than <strong>80 levels</strong> are waiting for you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Dodge and dazzle</strong> monsters using the arrow keys on your keyboard ⌨️ or a compatible controller 🎮. Play together with someone else <strong> cooperatively!</strong>🤜🤛<br><br>‎           ‎   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>‎           ‎   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will you master the multiple game modes? You can even create your musical levels and share them with others!<br><br>‎  ‎     ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎   ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/0070347c1650d5a05f4d62f2d778c086.avif?t=1666975190\" width=350 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>And Nekomew's Potty Trouble owners can get special content!</strong><br><br><br>   ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ Join Nekomew in this spooky adventure. Will you discover the origin?<br><br><strong>Available languages</strong><br>✔ Spanish (Spain)<br>✔ Catalan<br>✔ English<br>✔ Simplified Chinese<br>✔ Korean<br>✔ Japanese<br>✔ Portuguese<br>✔ French<br>✔ German<br>✔ Italian",
